<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="Trang-1" id="Nm1zeZC-iQIiWG-e538T">
    <mxGraphModel dx="2889" dy="1600" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="4681" pageHeight="3300" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle DV01 — Development View: Component Architecture (MVP Target)\n\nleft to right direction\nskinparam componentStyle uml2\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam linetype ortho\nskinparam defaultFontName \&quot;Segoe UI\&quot;\nskinparam packageBackgroundColor #F8FAFC\nskinparam packageBorderColor #64748B\nskinparam componentBackgroundColor #FFFFFF\nskinparam componentBorderColor #0284C7\nskinparam interfaceBackgroundColor #E0F2FE\nskinparam interfaceBorderColor #0284C7\nskinparam ArrowColor #475569\nskinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBEB\nskinparam NoteBorderColor #D97706\n\npackage \&quot;Presentation\\nExisting UI prototype — mockup only\&quot; as Presentation {\n    component \&quot;Student Mobile\\nexperience\&quot; as StudentUI\n    component \&quot;Operator Field Mobile\\nexperience\&quot; as OperatorMobileUI\n    component \&quot;Operator Web Dashboard\\nexperience\&quot; as OperatorWebUI\n    component \&quot;Shared Preview Shell\\nindex.html + app.js\&quot; as PreviewShell\n\n}\n\npackage \&quot;Smart E-Mobility Hub Backend\\nMVP target — Modular Monolith\&quot; as Backend {\n    package \&quot;API / Interface\&quot; as ApiLayer {\n        component \&quot;Express HTTP API\\n(target)\&quot; as HttpApi\n    }\n\n    package \&quot;Application\&quot; as ApplicationLayer {\n        package \&quot;Use-case Modules\&quot; as UseCaseModules {\n            component \&quot;Accounts &amp; Resources\\nVehicleService (resource queries/lifecycle)\\nUC01–02, UC08–09\&quot; as AccountsResources\n            component \&quot;Reservations &amp; Trips\\nReservationHub; trip coordination\\nUC03–06; FR-NI01\&quot; as ReservationsTrips\n            component \&quot;Charging\\nChargingScheduler\\nUC07, UC12\&quot; as Charging\n            component \&quot;Operations\\nRedistributionService;\\nIncidentService; TelemetryService\\nUC08–11; FR-NI02–04\&quot; as Operations\n            component \&quot;Simulation\\nSimulationEngine\\nUC13–14\&quot; as Simulation\n        }\n\n        interface \&quot;Persistence Ports\\nResource / Reservation / Charging /\\nOperations / Simulation repositories\&quot; as RepositoryPorts\n        interface \&quot;Notification Outbound Port\&quot; as NotificationOutput\n        interface \&quot;Telemetry Input Contract\\n(application use-case contract)\&quot; as TelemetryInput\n    }\n\n    package \&quot;Domain\&quot; as DomainLayer {\n        component \&quot;Domain Model &amp; Business Invariants\\nAccounts, hubs, vehicles, slots,\\nreservations, trips, charging,\\ntransfers, incidents, simulations\&quot; as DomainModel\n    }\n\n    package \&quot;Infrastructure\&quot; as InfrastructureLayer {\n        component \&quot;SQLite Repository Adapter\\n(implementation target)\&quot; as SqliteAdapter\n        component \&quot;SQLite Persistence\\n(technology target)\&quot; as Sqlite\n        component \&quot;Simulated Telemetry Adapter\\n(MVP option; real protocol TBD)\&quot; as SimulatedTelemetry\n        component \&quot;Mock Notification Adapter\\n(MVP option; provider TBD)\&quot; as MockNotification\n    }\n}\n\n&#39; Planned client-to-API dependencies; the current mockups are not wired to this API.\nStudentUI ..&gt; HttpApi : planned HTTP\nOperatorMobileUI ..&gt; HttpApi : planned HTTP\nOperatorWebUI ..&gt; HttpApi : planned HTTP\n\nHttpApi ..&gt; UseCaseModules : uses\nUseCaseModules ..&gt; DomainModel : uses\nUseCaseModules ..&gt; RepositoryPorts : uses\nUseCaseModules ..&gt; NotificationOutput : uses\nOperations ..|&gt; TelemetryInput : realizes\n\nSqliteAdapter ..|&gt; RepositoryPorts : realizes\nSqliteAdapter ..&gt; Sqlite : persists state\nHttpApi ..&gt; TelemetryInput : submits telemetry\nSimulatedTelemetry ..&gt; TelemetryInput : submits telemetry\nMockNotification ..|&gt; NotificationOutput : realizes\n\nnote bottom of Backend\n  Logical components only — not deployment nodes or separate services.\n  Atomic reservation/allocation and state transitions require transaction boundaries.\n  Repository ports hide SQLite details from application and domain rules.\n  Application owns its input/output contracts; API and infrastructure adapters call them.\nend note\n\nnote bottom of Presentation\n  The three experiences are mockups rendered through a shared preview shell.\n  Planned API integration is not implemented in the current prototype.\nend note\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="N3_0i0WL62QXr0Stusvt-17">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
